# Build context for apps/api, apps/tracker, apps/worker's Dockerfiles is
# this whole apps/ directory (the single Go module root the three
# binaries share, ARCHITECTURE.md's "modular monolith") — everything
# below is real but irrelevant to a Go build, and web/ in particular is
# large enough (node_modules) to make every Go image build slow without
# this.
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/coverage
**/*_test.go
**/.git
